+The current CI conformance checkout is rc.3. It does not supply schema-v6 cases. A root producer must not make ordinary CI collection fail merely because v6 candidate files are absent, and must not move the committed protocol pin. Candidate-root qualification is explicit evidence, not a root-task pin change.
